  "notes": [
    "ipc_added in this report is inproc_added (#1043): (t_decode - t0) with no hop; hop_in is the submit call (command decode + queue), extract is orrery_host_step, encode is orrery_host_collect_states, hop_out is one clock read, decode_out is the C-side decode of every record",
